From 1886a08cce62c09d30807b8075e74122fa73fb05 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Quintin Smits <qd.smits@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 09:55:44 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] feat(ui): tool Properties summary, holder pick and Body
 section in the tool library window

A saved tool's Properties page is a read-only summary with the door
"Edit in tool library". The holder picker leaves the tool shape window.
The tool library window's Tool tab gets a folded Body section (the
stand-in holder cylinder and the body import, placement and pieces) from
its own body draft. The Recipes tab takes the rest of the old Cutting
data group. The tests that drove the Properties fields and the shape
window's picker move to the window.

Fixes #3930

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
